<div id="u-credit-00160-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leaven" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5979701); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5979701&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608517680" alt="LEAVEN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5979701)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leaven" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5979701); return false;">LEAVEN</a></span></p>
